<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="bionics.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="bionics">
    <!-- Tier 2 screen #2 (show_bionics_ui). Tab bar (ACTIVE/PASSIVE, lifted into
         theme.rcss as the shared .tabs/.tab component) over a SINGLE list showing
         the current tab's bionics — each row "<key> <name>, <power props>" with
         the legacy colour baked in. A titlebar line shows bionic power + fuel +
         mode hints; the examine pane (right) appears only in EXAMINING mode.
         Single visible list → the selected-row accent + "> " marker just track
         the cursor (no focused-column gating like mutations). The CBM-slot
         connector graphic (CBM_SLOTS_ENABLED, default off) is dropped — semantic
         rewrite. Modes/toggles (examine/reassign/fuel/auto-start/sprite/sort) +
         activation stay on input_context; RmlUi renders + handles mouse only. -->
    <div class="panel bio-panel">
        <div class="bio-title" data-rml="title_rml"></div>

        <div class="tabs bio-tabs">
            <div class="item tab" data-class-selected="active_tab"
                 data-event-click="on_tab(0)" data-rml="active_tab_label_rml"></div>
            <div class="item tab" data-class-selected="!active_tab"
                 data-event-click="on_tab(1)" data-rml="passive_tab_label_rml"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="bio-main">
            <div class="bio-pane scroll-pane">
                <div class="bio-none" data-if="empty" data-rml="empty_rml"></div>
                <div class="bio-line" data-for="row : rows"
                     data-class-selected="row.selected"
                     data-event-mouseover="on_select(it_index)"
                     data-event-click="on_select(it_index)">
                    <span data-rml="row.text_rml"></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bio-examine scroll-pane" data-if="examining" data-rml="examine_rml"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
